er lets you unleash broken combos that can wipe out enemies in a single turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/e83e2ceca2c9bed26882035c63cb32dc.avif?t=1764368954\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/4fb30448fa7e21914651f482a7637be0.poster.avif?t=1764368954\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/4fb30448fa7e21914651f482a7637be0.webm?t=1764368954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/4fb30448fa7e21914651f482a7637be0.mp4?t=1764368954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>hundreds of Runes</strong>, dozens of skills, multiple playable characters, artifacts, items, events, and enemies, no two runs will ever feel the same. Unlock more options as you play and experiment with new builds each time you challenge Chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/extras/3cfb991af249630d9a950b65dc823f38.avif?t=1764368954\" width=1200 height=160 /></span></p>","developers":["Machinator Corp"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716760/5e2ae9cf54b1300e43bf